# FileFlows Real Image workspace contract

Use `.vscode/` as the canonical shared workspace configuration.
The container build system is Docker BuildKit / Dockerfile with multi-stage targets:
use `docker build -t <tag> --build-arg FLAVOR=<flavor> .` or `make build`.

Preserve every existing agent integration, including Antigravity, Claude Code, Cursor,
Codex, Copilot, and repository tooling. Never disable or suppress one through workspace settings.

Always keep `Dockerfile` and `Dockerfile.optimized` in 100% lockstep.
Run `make test-docs` and `make lint` before handoff and do not commit generated build output.
